{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"AppcuesKit"}],"role":"article","title":"Configuring a Custom Component"},"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/CustomComponentConfiguring","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesCustomComponentViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" allows your app to define a custom component that can be rendered in an experience containing a custom component block using the registered "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" for the component."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Implementing a custom component","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Implementing-a-custom-component"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conform a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" to the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesCustomComponentViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol by implementing an initializer, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesCustomComponentViewController\/init(configuration:actionController:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The initializer provides a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesExperiencePluginConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object which includes a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesExperiencePluginConfiguration\/decode(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method to deserialize the component configuration into a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Decodable"},{"type":"text","text":" type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["extension MyViewController: AppcuesCustomComponentViewController {","    struct Config: Decodable {","        let stringProperty: String","        let numberProperty: Double","        let boolProperty: Bool ","    }","","    convenience init?(configuration: AppcuesKit.AppcuesExperiencePluginConfiguration, actionController: AppcuesExperienceActions) {","        guard let config = configuration.decode(Config.self) else { return nil }","        ","        \/\/ Initialize your view controller with the decoded configuration:","        \/\/ config.stringProperty, etc","        self.init()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is required that the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewController.preferredContentSize"},{"type":"text","text":" property be set to the size required by your component. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferredContentSize"},{"type":"text","text":" is not set your custom component may not be allocated any space when rendering in an Appcues experience. There are several approaches to accomplish this including overriding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferredContentSize"},{"type":"text","text":" or setting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferredContentSize"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"viewDidLayoutSubviews()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Invoking-actions","level":3,"text":"Invoking actions"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your custom component may want to interact with the Appcues context and manipulate the experience it’s embedded in. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesCustomComponentViewController\/init(configuration:actionController:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" provides an action controller ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesExperienceActions","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") to accomplish this."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesExperienceActions\/triggerBlockActions()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" will invoke the actions added to the custom component in the Appcues Mobile Builder."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Registering a custom component","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Registering-a-custom-component"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Registering a custom component by calling  "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/registerCustomComponent(identifier:type:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when your app starts. Ensure the identifier is an unique string when registering multiple custom components."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Appcues.registerCustomComponent(identifier: \"myViewController\", type: MyViewController.self)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Testing a custom component","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Testing-a-custom-component"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All registered custom view are listed in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Debugger"},{"type":"text","text":" under the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Plugins"},{"type":"text","text":" section. Refer to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Debugging","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provide a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesCustomComponentViewController\/debugConfig-57bo8","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on your custom component view controller to test an instance of your custom component:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["extension MyViewController {","    static var debugConfig: [String: Any]? {","        [","            \"stringProperty\": \"some string\",","            \"numberProperty\": 3.14,","            \"boolProperty\": true","        ]","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The debugger page for a custom component instance will also show a list of actions invoked by the custom component."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Define a custom component to be rendered in an experience.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit"]]},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesCustomComponentViewController","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesExperienceActions","doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/AppcuesExperiencePluginConfiguration"],"title":"Custom Components","generated":true,"anchor":"Custom-Components"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/appcueskit\/customcomponentconfiguring"]}],"references":{"doc://com.appcues.sdk/documentation/AppcuesKit/Appcues/registerCustomComponent(identifier:type:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/appcueskit\/appcues\/registercustomcomponent(identifier:type:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.appcues.sdk\/documentation\/AppcuesKit\/Appcues\/registerCustomComponent(identifier:type:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Register a view controller that can be rendered in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Experience"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"